  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FBD</mi></math> of block <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> w.r.t. wedge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>, for maximum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>'</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>'</mo></math>:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0107_580c03e42568.jpg\" style=\"width: 215px; height: 151px;\" /></p><p>Perpendicular to wedge:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Σf</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>mgcosθ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>masinθ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Σ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>mgsin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>macos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo></math> (for maximum a)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi>mgsinθ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>mgcosθ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>masinθ</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>macosθ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>gsinθ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>μgcosθ</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>cosθ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>μsinθ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p>"
